  "body": "If your family needs more space, somewhere to park the boat and room for a few weekend projects, 32 Castaway Place could be just the ticket. Set on a generous 903sqm freehold section, there's an oversized double garage, separate workshop and plenty of off-street parking, along with lovely elevated views across Gulf Harbour and the golf course. The sunny decking is perfect for a BBQ with friends, while the established gardens and private setting give the kids and pets room to enjoy. Our sellers have found their next home and have a deadline to beat!\r\n\r\nFeatures you'll love:\r\n* 903sqm freehold section, tucked away from the road, great for children and pets\r\n* Elevated outlook across Gulf Harbour and the golf course\r\n* Like new wrap around decking with louvre covered alfresco dining space\r\n* Sunny conservatory with expansive views\r\n* Weatherboard construction\r\n* Mezzanine second floor and feature timber ceilings\r\n* Heat pumps for year-round comfort\r\n* Oversized double garage plus workshop\r\n* Parking galore - ideal for cars, the boat, tools or projects\r\n* Mature gardens and fruit trees\r\n* Privacy and a genuine sense of escape\r\n* Excellent schools nearby including Wentworth College & Primary\r\n\r\nSet in a peaceful pocket near the golf course, excellent schools, Shakespear Regional Park and the Gulf Harbour marina giving the option of a ferry commute to Auckland CBD - this is a home that offers the feeling of getting away from it all without sacrificing convenience. Enjoy your morning coffee overlooking the greenery, potter in the garden, tackle a project in the workshop or simply soak up the outlook and privacy. It's a lifestyle with space to breathe.\r\n\r\nCome and explore 32 Castaway Place for yourself, homes with this much privacy, character, garaging and outlook don't come along every day.\r\n\r\nTo download the property documents visit: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/C4DW\r\n\r\nBuilding report available\r\nFlexible settlement terms available.\r\nOther agents - bring your buyers. Conjunctionals welcome.",
